---
import '~/assets/style/selection.scss';

import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="py-8 mx-auto w-main">
    <div class="flex items-center mb-12">
      <div class="bg-theme-red-light w-[480px] h-[600px] rounded-r-[80px] rounded-bl-[80px] mr-[40px] p-8 relative">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/30 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-r-[80px] rounded-bl-[80px]"></div>
        <h2 class="relative z-10 mb-12 text-3xl">
          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-red selection-prefix">React</span>
          <br />
          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-red selection-suffix">从入门到放弃</span>
        </h2>
        <p>The library for web and native user interfaces.</p>
        <br />
        <br />
        <p class="text">React is an essential part of my frontend development toolkit. It’s simple and flexible, yet capable of solving complex UI challenges. This series of notes captures my journey of learning and practicing React, including component-based development, state management, and some unique tips and tricks. I hope these insights will offer new perspectives and inspiration for your development journey.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-theme-yellow-light w-[480px] h-[600px] rounded-l-[80px] rounded-tr-[80px] p-8 relative">
        <h2 class="relative z-10 mb-12 text-3xl">
          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow selection-prefix">JavaScript</span>
          <br />
          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow">基础篇</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-center justify-end">
      <div class="bg-theme-blue w-[480px] h-[600px] rounded-t-[80px] rounded-br-[80px] mr-[40px]">
      </div>
      <div class="bg-theme-green w-[480px] h-[600px] rounded-b-[80px] rounded-tl-[80px]">
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
